      "message": "Hey Diana,\n\nWhat is the deprecation plan regarding USB_PD_CONTROL? This will help determine how we can introduce usage of TYPEC_STATUS in the kernel driver.\n\nSince the contents of USB_PD_CONTROL will now be split between TYPEC_STATUS and TYPEC_DISCOVERY (te latter will provide what was earlier control_flags, cable_speed and cable_gen), having USB_PD_CONTROL around will help us transition more smoothly to TYPEC_STATUS+TYPEC_DISCOVERY usage in kernel (we can first introduce TYPEC_STATUS, and then TYPEC_DISCOVERY).\n\nIf not, then we can determine what\u0027s the best way to integrate the new commands.\n\nBest regards,",
